  "scientific_changes": [
    "Added a provisional measured-retinotopy view using Pilot-QC median per-unit RF grid argmax coordinates; the response panels use the selected versioned grating metric.",
    "Replaced the pooled-SF MouseV2 grating overlay with Allen Welch-spectrum modulation index; preferred conditions include orientation x temporal frequency x spatial frequency.",
    "Recomputed MouseV2 TTFS and response timescale from the 'pooled' flash presentation set; TTFS is raw relative to NWB start_time and timescale bins are selected by AllenSDK centers.",
    "Applied the named population profile 'common_qc' to both Allen and MouseV2 tables before metric-specific filters.",
    "Replaced pseudo-hierarchy positions for known within-V1 recordings with small display-only offsets centered on VISp and removed the invalid within-V1 hierarchy regression."
  ],
